# TomTom Traffic API key.
#
# 1. Create a free account at https://developer.tomtom.com/
# 2. Make a key with the "Traffic API" product enabled.
# 3. Copy this file to `.env` and paste the key below.
#
# Free tier: 2,500 requests/day. This site uses 10 per refresh and refreshes
# every 2 minutes, so a single tab costs ~300 requests/hour.
#
# IMPORTANT — this is a static site, so the key ships inside the JavaScript
# bundle and anyone can read it. Before publishing, restrict the key in the
# TomTom dashboard to your GitHub Pages origin. Without that restriction,
# treat the key as public and rotate it after the presentation.
VITE_TOMTOM_KEY=
